    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>&quot;10MIN HEROES&quot;</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players progress through the map by defeating enemies and aiming for the goal. The time limit is 10 minutes, but players can restart as many times as they need within that period. Reaching the goal strengthens skills, allowing players to become more powerful as they advance. Power-up items found mid-area can upgrade weapons or restore health.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Classic Pixel Art and Sound:</u></strong><br>Retro graphics and sound effects enhance the gaming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Simple Controls:</u></strong><br>Use twin-stick controls with a gamepad, or opt for mouse and keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Short Play Sessions:</u></strong><br>Each game session is up to 10 minutes, with the objective to clear each area within that time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Level-Up System:</u></strong><br>Skills improve with each level goal achieved, allowing players to grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Variety of Enemies and Bosses:</u></strong><br>Encounter over 50 unique enemies and bosses, requiring strategic combat. Rare characters discovered can also be unlocked as allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rewards and Unlockable Content:</u></strong><br>Unlock rare items and over 20 unique weapons.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342150/extras/efdb5c9864b47e26c8fe3cff942f1f54.avif?t=1731728321\" data-has-big width=800 height=2280 /></span></p>",
